# Local run outputs — never commit these. They are regenerated on every run:
#   - out.gate0a.json   written by deploy/run_0a.sh (copied back from the Gate-0A host)
#   - scripts/output.json  the `promptfoo eval -o output.json` result that results_to_scores.py folds in
# They carry per-run data (and can trip secret-scanning on synthetic canary fixtures), and nothing
# reads them as committed artifacts — SKILL.md / references/promptfoo-wrapper.md describe regenerating them.
/out.gate0a.json
/scripts/output.json
